        "height": 652,
        "content": "## 1. Read the email (Basic LLM Chain)\nGemini extracts stage, sentiment, objections, next action, owner, due date, risk and a draft reply."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "0d92b4e0-f49e-4372-9905-a28c3224a628",
